  "dct_description_sm": [
    "This web application shows the locations of licensed commercial community kitchens available for rent throughout Manitoba. Each kitchen has a Food Service Establishment permit issued by Manitoba Health, and is a suitable facility to produce value-added food products for sale. Details about each kitchen facility includes a list of available equipment, address and contact information, and pictures of the kitchen and equipment.<div><br /></div><div>This application uses the <a href='https://manitoba.maps.arcgis.com/home/item.html?id=306cfdbd388e4a6e8abaf3691004c59b&amp;view=table&amp;sortOrder=desc&amp;sortField=defaultFSOrder#overview' target='_blank' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>Manitoba Commercial Community Kitchens</a> feature point layer and the <a href='https://manitoba.maps.arcgis.com/home/item.html?id=9efe19bc92b445c292ce2c14e7ba025d' target='_blank' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>Manitoba Commercial Community Kitchens</a> map.</div>"
